                mostPopularCar = car;
                maxCount = car.getCount();
            }
        }

        return mostPopularCar.getCount();
    }
}
```

This Java method `getCountAndColor` takes a list of `Car` objects and returns the count of the most popular car, which is the car with the highest count. If there are multiple cars with the same highest count, it will return the count of any one of them. The method also checks if the input list is empty or null and throws an `IllegalArgumentException` if it is.

